{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Wildcard Roll the Bones grants one random enhancement per roll (#9145)",
  "contract": [
    "Tooltip 760080: Roll the dice of fate, providing a random lesser or great combat enhancement for $760082d.",
    "Only one enhancement can be active at the same time.",
    "760080 effect 1 is Ascension effect 184 (trigger random spell, EffectTriggerSpell 760082), which the core left as",
    "EffectNULL, so the cast only played its visual. The lesser and greater enhancements are the eight Spell.dbc",
    "records 760082-760089: Skull and Crossbones, Buried Treasure, Cutthroat Efficiency and Ruthless Precision.",
    "Each roll must leave exactly one of the eight on the caster. The DBC gives no weights, so the pick is uniform;",
    "80 rolls leave a given enhancement unused with probability (7/8)^80 (2e-5), so every enhancement must appear.",
    "Roll the Bones exists only for the Hero class (10), which is why the fixture uses class 10."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 240000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 10,
      "level": 60,
      "allow_regeneration": false
    }
  ],
